### Diagnosis
- **Overfitting is the main issue**: AmpPredictor best test_amp_loss at ep66/200, train-test gap = 0.125 (vs exp016's 0.056). The larger model overfits faster.
- **Frozen encoder is the structural ceiling**: AmpPredictor can only use what the frozen encoder provides. Baseline jointly trains encoder+amp head.

